        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WT4BI, 10-3/4\" Warwick Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10-3/4 Inch Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Lockset is perfect for restoration projects because of its old world design and material. It features a S-shaped grip off set by lovely mounts that look as if they have been inspired by nature. The black iron finish is guaranteed not to rust. For doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick with a 2-1/2 inch or  2-3/4 inch backset. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumbpiece from the both sides.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUnlike a simple tubular latch, this is a mortise lock. They are extremely durable and have a tighter clearance tolerance. You know it's a mortise lock when you hear that heavy, smooth, solid 'click' when the door closes shut.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a thumbpiece from both the exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/warwick-dummy-lockset-wt4bd\"><b>Warwick Dummy Locket</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/double-cylinder-10-3-4-inch-warwick-mortise-lockset-acorn-wtlbi\"><b>Warwick Double Cylinder Mortise Lockset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 10-3/4 Inch Warwick Single Cylinder Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li> \r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: interior and exterior handle, thumbturn, cylinder, and all necessary mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specification</b> for the Acorn WT4BI Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Cylinder Rose Length: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Cylinder Rose Width: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handle Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior and Interior Handle Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise: 8” x 1-1/4”</li>\r\n<li>Case: 6” x 3-5/8” x 15/16”</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 3/4” throw</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1” throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8” ASA</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Hubs: 3/16” on the diamond.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>",
            "seo": {
